<title>GREECE: Greek Athibor late due to technical problems.</title>
<headline>Greek Athibor late due to technical problems.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek Athibor rates will be late on Wednesday due to technical difficulties, the Hellenic Bank Association said. It gave no other details.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
